{D} I'm looking for help to get OUT of a shop.  In [shop] I zapped myself
{D} with a wand of Make Invisible.  [N]ow Ossipewsk won't let me out of the
{D} shop.

Oh.  If you are invisible the shopkeeper grows roots at the door to the
shop.  Essentially he well never move.

{D} How can I get out of the shop? I haven't got anything to dig with and no
{D} teleport-type stuff.

Options:
1) If you can kill him from a distance this is a good way out.  Remember the
   shopkeeper ain't going to move, but will swing if you are close enough.

2) Wait for the game to generate a dwarf, or rock mole to eat away the level
   and open a wall of the shop so you can leave.  This requires food.

Good luck.

